{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Committed 92ed6fb55b3, pushed as Gerrit change 3130. All 6 checksums compared equal to the astral-sh/uv 0.13.6 release .sha256 assets in both action.yml and REQUIRED_CHECKSUMS. Under uv 0.13.6: make venv + make install succeeded in a fresh worktree; uv lock --check passes on the committed uv.lock; check_uv_pin.py passes; make verify 19828 passed, 0 failed. Two tests mirrored the live pin and were updated (guard fixtures carry the new checksums; the worktree pin test now derives the stub uv version from pyproject.toml). Open: MCP image build with the 0.13.6 stage, and CI logs showing uv 0.13.6."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793241295816606001,"uuid":"0105baf5-2768-499a-916a-06456ae1269d"}